# FreeRTOS Kernel Placeholder
# This directory will contain the FreeRTOS kernel source.
# It can be populated via:
# 1. Git submodule: git submodule add https://github.com/FreeRTOS/FreeRTOS-Kernel freertos-kernel
# 2. Vendored: Download and extract FreeRTOS into this directory
#
# Expected structure:
# freertos-kernel/
# ├── Source/
# │   ├── FreeRTOS.h
# │   ├── portable/
# │   │   ├── GCC/ARM_CA/
# │   │   └── GCC/posix/
# │   └── ... (other kernel sources)
# └── License/
